      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这场唯独爱你的采访，\n伴随着伟业，\n瞬间在比赛迷之间传开了――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1cfd3c28aabf81d12e4c06f558ba437d03cc8572d454b47796ce932d41f2736",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
